      "content": "Breastmilk isn't just food — it's a real-time immune engineering system 🧬\n\nWhen a baby latches, their saliva signals enter through the nipple. Mom's immune system reads those signals, detects pathogens the baby encountered, and engineers targeted antibodies — within 4 hours.\n\nThe milk literally adapts to what your baby needs right now.\n\n#breastfeeding #babyfacts #immunesystem #newbornfacts #motherhood #sciencefacts #parenting #infant",
